    "detailed_description": "Ash's life, a former programmer taking refuge in the simplicity of her father's caf\u00e9, Cat's, turns into a whirlwind of mysteries and emotions. Her days, once filled with the monotonous hum of coffee beans, now witness intriguing encounters with talking cats and the witnessing of inexplicable events.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile grappling with the shadow of past traumas stemming from an ex-girlfriend, Ash undergoes an internal journey at Cat's. Amid challenges such as low self-esteem, self-sabotage, and fear of rejection, she finds herself immersed in a world of conflicting emotions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, the apparent tranquility is shattered by an inexplicable event involving the local church. Ash and her eccentric colleagues are catapulted into a cosmic chaos that transcends human understanding. Mutants, demons, and the intricate layers of the multiverse come into play, challenging not only the order of Cat's but also reality itself.",
    "about_the_game": "Ash's life, a former programmer taking refuge in the simplicity of her father's caf\u00e9, Cat's, turns into a whirlwind of mysteries and emotions. Her days, once filled with the monotonous hum of coffee beans, now witness intriguing encounters with talking cats and the witnessing of inexplicable events.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile grappling with the shadow of past traumas stemming from an ex-girlfriend, Ash undergoes an internal journey at Cat's. Amid challenges such as low self-esteem, self-sabotage, and fear of rejection, she finds herself immersed in a world of conflicting emotions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, the apparent tranquility is shattered by an inexplicable event involving the local church. Ash and her eccentric colleagues are catapulted into a cosmic chaos that transcends human understanding. Mutants, demons, and the intricate layers of the multiverse come into play, challenging not only the order of Cat's but also reality itself.",
    "short_description": "Enjoy the atmosphere of a nice cafeteria, hear people's problems, confessions, connect to them. Set aside monotonous days and embark on an adventure involving the multiverse, demons, and mutants. Wasn't it supposed to be just a cafeteria?",
